'''Dragonite''' (Japanese: '''カイリュー''' ''Kairyu'') is a {{ct|Dragon}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

